ragraph\" >Race through the Rainbow Reef, the Sandstone Spires, the Cracked Shell Crater, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.poster.avif?t=1767055075\" aria-label=\"Nitro Turtles racing through tropical environments.\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.webm?t=1767055075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/extras/c9f554da31acc6130b49e0f67f43e4ef.mp4?t=1767055075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against your friends with online, split screen, or LAN multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also play against bots if you have no friends :(</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cool shell gadgets to reach speeds turtles never thought possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in 9 vibrant and unique courses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun / time trials mode with online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Performance-enhancing seaweed has not been tested for safety and likely has numerous side effects :O</p>","developers":["Lucky Turtle"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952070/a90574ed58185b4f2cab6932a3c49dd6bb7f2f3e/header.jpg?t=1767055075","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u